OL,3,AMajor Thanksgiving storm brings        
OL,4,Aflooding, flight delays across US      
OL,6,FMeanwhile, almost one million          
OL,7,Fhouseholds were without power on       
OL,8,FThursday night, with Pennsylvania,     
OL,9,FMaryland and Virginia the hardest hit  
OL,10,Fstates.                                
